OL,3,CMan who lost home in Stourbridge
OL,4,Cwildfire demands tougher action from
OL,5,Cgovernment
OL,7,FFamilies who lost almost everything in
OL,8,Fthe wildfires that spread through the
OL,9,FWest Midlands town of Stourbridge,
OL,10,Fhave begun returning to the burnt-out
OL,11,Fremains of their homes, as ITV News
OL,12,FCorrespondent Neil Connery reports
OL,14,FA man whose house was destroyed by the
OL,15,FStourbridge wildfires has warned that
OL,16,Ffire services need greater support and
OL,17,Fresourcing.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
