OL,3,CMan who lost home in Stourbridge
OL,4,Cwildfire demands tougher action from
OL,5,Cgovernment
OL,7,FLast week, Richard Vinten, his wife
OL,8,FRose-Anne and their young family were
OL,9,Fforced to evacuate their home as
OL,10,Fwildfire tore through their property.
OL,12,FThe Vintens had only lived in their
OL,13,Fnew home for five months.
OL,15,FMuch of the lower floor of their home
OL,16,Fwas completely gutted by the blaze,
OL,17,Fwhich destroyed or damaged almost 40
OL,18,Fhomes in the area. West Midlands Fire
OL,19,FService declared a major incident on
OL,20,FThursday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1787006888
OL,3,CMan who lost home in Stourbridge
OL,4,Cwildfire demands tougher action from
OL,5,Cgovernment
OL,7,FStood in front of the remains of his
OL,8,Ffamily home, Richard Vinten told ITV
OL,9,FNews that the tragic incident should
OL,10,F"100%" be a wake up call.
OL,12,F"This is scary", he said. "This is
OL,13,Fgenuinely scary.
OL,15,F"We've seen all the fires across all
OL,16,Fof Europe as well... it's terrifying,
OL,17,Fit's absolutely terrifying."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
