CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1787006888
OL,3,CMan who lost home in Stourbridge
OL,4,Cwildfire demands tougher action from
OL,5,Cgovernment
OL,7,FGiving his message to the government,
OL,8,FRichard said: "Look at it, just look
OL,9,Fat it. You can't pretend it's not
OL,10,Freal. You can't pretend it's not
OL,11,Fhappening."
OL,13,FRichard praised the efforts of the
OL,14,Ffire brigade, but expressed concerns
OL,15,Fover budget cuts and lack of
OL,16,Fresources, as he told ITV News that
OL,17,F"we're not prepared for this in this
OL,18,Fcountry".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1787006888
OL,3,CMan who lost home in Stourbridge
OL,4,Cwildfire demands tougher action from
OL,5,Cgovernment
OL,7,FRichard's wife, Rose-Anne, is a nurse
OL,8,Fin the NHS, another service which he
OL,9,Fsaid is "struggling" from budget cuts.
OL,11,F"Our emergency services are so
OL,12,Fimportant" he said, adding that they
OL,13,Fneed "as much support" as possible.
OL,15,F"I spoke to a fire officer who had
OL,16,Fbeen the service for over 20 years
OL,17,Flast week and they have never, ever
OL,18,Fdealt with things like that", he added.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
