PN,30906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1787006888
OL,3,CMan who lost home in Stourbridge
OL,4,Cwildfire demands tougher action from
OL,5,Cgovernment
OL,7,F"They were running out of water, they
OL,8,Fwere running out of hoses... There's
OL,9,Fpeople with pools, ponds and stuff,
OL,10,Fand they had to break in to their
OL,11,Fhouse to pump the water out of that...
OL,12,F(it) was evaporating before it was
OL,13,Feven hitting some of the houses."
OL,15,FWest Midlands Fire Service's Chief
OL,16,FFire Officer, Simon Tuhill, spoke on
OL,17,FThursday to thank both his own crews
OL,18,Fand those who came to assist them.
OL,26,@tD@ApmtD@Dpn
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1787006888
OL,3,CMan who lost home in Stourbridge
OL,4,Cwildfire demands tougher action from
OL,5,Cgovernment
OL,7,F"We have support from a number of
OL,8,Fother Fire and Rescue services," he
OL,9,Fsaid. "My thanks to both Staffordshire
OL,10,Fand Hereford and Worcester Fire and
OL,11,FRescue Services.
OL,13,F"I'll finish initially by saying thank
OL,14,Fyou both to the members of the public
OL,15,Fwho have been here all day supporting
OL,16,Fus, providing us food and drink and
OL,17,Fbest wishes, and I know that my crews
OL,18,Fare deeply grateful for that."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
