OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1787006888
OL,3,CMan who lost home in Stourbridge
OL,4,Cwildfire demands tougher action from
OL,5,Cgovernment
OL,7,FLast week wildfires ravaged across
OL,8,Fareas of the UK, including in South
OL,9,FWales, the New Forest, and in the
OL,10,FCairngorms in Scotland, as
OL,11,Ftemperatures soared and the hottest
OL,12,Fday of the year was recorded.
OL,14,FOn Friday evening, millions of people
OL,15,Fin England and Wales received an alert
OL,16,Fon their mobile devices warning them
OL,17,Fof a "very high risk of wildfires
OL,18,Fnationally".
OL,26,@yD@FOUzD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
