OL,3,CMan who lost home in Stourbridge
OL,4,Cwildfire demands tougher action from
OL,5,Cgovernment
OL,7,FIt came after Prime Minister Andy
OL,8,FBurnham described Britain as a
OL,9,F"tinderbox" and a temporary ban on
OL,10,Fdisposable barbecues was put in place.
OL,12,FOn Monday, Angela Rayner has visited
OL,13,Fthe burnt-out remains of homes in the
OL,14,FWest Midlands.
OL,16,FThe Housing Secretary could be seen
OL,17,Fwalking among the shells of houses at
OL,18,FQuarry Park Road, Stourbridge.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
