OL,3,CMan who lost home in Stourbridge
OL,4,Cwildfire demands tougher action from
OL,5,Cgovernment
OL,7,FTemperatures are set to cool, and rain
OL,8,Fis set to fall in some areas in coming
OL,9,Fdays, with a chance of further
OL,10,Fheatwaves developing afterwards,
OL,11,Fespecially in the South.
